!engines/cpu-renode/tests/firmware/nrf52840/zephyr/prebuilt/*.elf
# LOCAL-ONLY packages (LicenseRef-local-only, Phase 1 plan approver decision A3; ADR-006 D9 rule 4):
# `make dms-local-packages` builds the vendor-derived TPS22917 here. Never commit them.
/local-packages/
